    - rid: 164572784810786889
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 1
        text: Hiya mister, how are you! I saw you using that thing earlier to look
          at the stars. What does it do??
        choices:
        - choiceText: "It\u2019s an astrolabe, it helps me find my way."
          nextNodeID: 2
        - choiceText: "It\u2019s an astrolabe, it shows me the way."
          nextNodeID: 2
    - rid: 164572784810786890
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 2
        text: "That\u2019s so cool! How awesome of the stars to make sure you don\u2019t
          get lost!\r\n"
        choices:
        - choiceText: "You really love space don\u2019t you kid\r\n"
          nextNodeID: 3
        - choiceText: Why are you so interested in the stars?
          nextNodeID: 3
    - rid: 164572784810786891
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 3
        text: I just LOVE space, it's so cool!
        nextNodeID: 4
    - rid: 164572784810786892
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 4
        text: I want to be an astronaut when I grow up!
        nextNodeID: 5
    - rid: 164572784810786893
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 5
        text: What about you mister do you like space?
        choices:
        - choiceText: Yeah I like space, \n I actually do research on it
          nextNodeID: 6
        - choiceText: ' I research things to do with space so yeah, \n I guess you
            could say I like it.'
          nextNodeID: 6
    - rid: 164572784810786894
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 6
        text: 'Wow! your job is learning about space?? '
        nextNodeID: 7
    - rid: 164572784810786895
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 7
        text: 'That sounds awesome, maybe I can do that too when I grow up

'
        nextNodeID: 8
    - rid: 164572784810786896
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 8
        text: What kind of research do you do?
        choices:
        - choiceText: ' It''s nothing special really, \n sadly I couldn''t finish
            my research

'
          nextNodeID: 9
        - choiceText: Sadly i couldn't finish it, but its quiete difficult. \n So
            I dont think you would understand
          nextNodeID: 9
    - rid: 164572784810786897
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 9
        text: Oh no! Maybe I could finish your work when I grow up!
        choices:
        - choiceText: 'You know kid,  You would be perfect. \n You remind me a lot
            of myself. '
          nextNodeID: 10
        - choiceText: "Kid, I see my younger self in you. I think you would \\n be
            just the right person to finish my work.  \n"
          nextNodeID: 10
    - rid: 164572784810786898
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 10
        text: Thank you mister! I really enjoyed talking to you.
        nextNodeID: 11
    - rid: 164572784810786899
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 11
        text: 'Thanks to you, I want to become a researcher and be just like you
